{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Degui": 18,
    "Player": 3
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2230301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Degui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223030101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223030101": {
            "id": "223030101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Business seems to be grinding to a halt...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030102"
            ]
          },
          "223030102": {
            "id": "223030102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's wrong?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030103"
            ]
          },
          "223030103": {
            "id": "223030103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "I was just saying, business is getting tougher and tougher in this tavern of mine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030104"
            ]
          },
          "223030104": {
            "id": "223030104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "For us in the food and drink business, having a long history is both a blessing and a curse.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030105"
            ]
          },
          "223030105": {
            "id": "223030105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "The good part is, a long history gives you more of a reputation, which helps bring in business.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030106"
            ]
          },
          "223030106": {
            "id": "223030106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "The bad part is, people get bored of having the same thing over and over again. In big restaurants, where they have plenty of variety, that's obviously not a problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030107"
            ]
          },
          "223030107": {
            "id": "223030107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "But my tavern is only a small one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030108"
            ]
          },
          "223030108": {
            "id": "223030108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "My long-term regulars are now finally starting to get bored with the drinks, and one by one they're leaving...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030109"
            ]
          },
          "223030109": {
            "id": "223030109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "I've heard there's a big wine industry in Mondstadt. They have a famous Dandelion Wine, supposedly brewed with Dandelions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030110"
            ]
          },
          "223030110": {
            "id": "223030110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "I'm not even sure if brewing with Dandelions is possible... But I'd like to at least give it a try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030111"
            ]
          },
          "223030111": {
            "id": "223030111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Could you go to Mondstadt and fetch some Dandelions for me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030113",
              "223030115"
            ]
          },
          "223030113": {
            "id": "223030113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Great. You have my word I will pay you for your trouble. And in Liyue, our word is our bond."
          },
          "223030115": {
            "id": "223030115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "You think it's a strange flavor? That may be, but I've heard it's extremely popular in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030116"
            ]
          },
          "223030116": {
            "id": "223030116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Although, it's not going to sell if I just copy the exact same recipe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030117"
            ]
          },
          "223030117": {
            "id": "223030117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Anyway, start by bringing me some <color=#00E1FFFF>Dandelions</color>, and in the meantime, I will think about how to add a little Liyue touch to the brewing process."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230302",
      "subQuestName": "Give the Dandelion to Degui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223030201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223030201": {
            "id": "223030201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Did you find any <color=#00E1FFFF>Dandelions</color>?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2230303",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Degui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "223030301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "223030301": {
            "id": "223030301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "I will experiment a bit to start with, and see if I can add Dandelions in to a Liyue-style brewing process.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030302"
            ]
          },
          "223030302": {
            "id": "223030302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "Oh, and this is for you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "223030303"
            ]
          },
          "223030303": {
            "id": "223030303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Degui",
            "text": "I'm not expecting to get this right the first time. It will probably take me many attempts. If I run out of Dandelions, I may have to ask you to do another run for me."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}